	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1769523875094">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;">Genera reportes e informes para la gesti&oacute;n y auditor&iacute;a: consolida resultados, mide actividad por per&iacute;odos, <a class="glossaryLink"  aria-describedby="tt"  data-cmtooltip="&lt;div class=glossaryItemTitle&gt;Entidades&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=glossaryItemBody&gt;&amp;lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;Se refiere a los organismos p&uacute;blicos, servicios e instituciones del Estado regidos por la Ley de Compras P&uacute;blicas y su Reglamento.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;"  href="https://www.chilecompra.cl/glosario/entidades/"  data-gt-translate-attributes='[{"attribute":"data-cmtooltip", "format":"html"}]'  tabindex='0' role='link'>entidades</a> y territorios y exporta hallazgos.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_fadeInUp fadeInUp"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0063ae;">{<a href="#inicio">VOLVER AL INICIO</a>}</span></p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_fadeInUp fadeInUp"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12" id="informacion-disponible"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 50px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h1 style="font-size: 30px;color: #0f4aa3;line-height: 1.4;text-align: center;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:700;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading">Informaci&#xF3;n disponible</h1><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 15px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h1 style="font-size: 22px;color: #0f4aa3;line-height: 1.4;text-align: center;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:400;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading">Accede a los datos en l&#xED;nea de licitaciones, &#xF3;rdenes de compra, organismos compradores y proveedores del Estado.</h1><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 32px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><div class="vc_tta-container" data-vc-action="collapseAll"><div class="vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-accordion vc_tta-color-black vc_tta-style-outline vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-o-shape-group vc_tta-gap-1 vc_tta-controls-align-left vc_tta-o-no-fill vc_tta-o-all-clickable"><div class="vc_tta-panels-container"><div class="vc_tta-panels"><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1769524491975-53626512-0329" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a href="#1769524491975-53626512-0329" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">LICITACIONES</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><span style="color: #07272d;">Tienes acceso a informaci&#xF3;n para listar:&#xA0;</span></p>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">Licitaciones diarias&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">Licitaciones por c&#xF3;digo&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">Licitaciones diarias por estado&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">Licitaciones por d&#xED;a&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">Licitaciones por estado y d&#xED;a&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="6" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">Licitaciones por c&oacute;digo de organismo p&uacute;blico o <a class="glossaryLink"  aria-describedby="tt"  data-cmtooltip="&lt;div class=glossaryItemTitle&gt;Proveedor&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=glossaryItemBody&gt;&amp;lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;Persona natural o jur&iacute;dica, chilena o extranjera, o agrupaci&oacute;n de las mismas, que puedan proporcionar bienes y/o servicios a las instituciones del Estado.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;"  href="https://www.chilecompra.cl/glosario/proveedor/"  data-gt-translate-attributes='[{"attribute":"data-cmtooltip", "format":"html"}]'  tabindex='0' role='link'>proveedor</a>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><span class="TextRun SCXW229307146 BCX0" lang="ES-CL" xml:lang="ES-CL" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW229307146 BCX0">La API</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW229307146 BCX0">&#xA0;fue implementada para que las&#xA0;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW229307146 BCX0">URLs</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW229307146 BCX0">&#xA0;puedan ser utilizadas mediante par&#xE1;metros&#xA0;</span></span><span class="TextRun Highlight SCXW229307146 BCX0" lang="ES-CL" xml:lang="ES-CL" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW229307146 BCX0">GET, con el objetivo de indicar las caracter&#xED;sticas de la petici&#xF3;n que se ejecuta.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW229307146 BCX0" data-ccp-props='{"134233117":true,"134233118":true,"201341983":0,"335551550":6,"335551620":6,"335557856":16777215,"335559739":0,"335559740":240}'>&#xA0;</span></p>

