	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h2 style="font-size: 16px;color: #07272d;line-height: 1,4;text-align: left;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:500;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading">Por todos los estados de una {fecha} en particular</h2><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><span class="TextRun SCXW107265725 BCX0" lang="ES-CL" xml:lang="ES-CL" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW107265725 BCX0">Ejemplo de {fecha} = 02022014</span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW107265725 BCX0"><span class="SCXW107265725 BCX0">&#xA0;</span><br class="SCXW107265725 BCX0"></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW107265725 BCX0"><span class="SCXW107265725 BCX0">&#xA0;</span><br class="SCXW107265725 BCX0"></span><a href="https://api.mercadopublico.cl/servicios/v1/publico/licitaciones.json?fecha=02022014&amp;ticket=F8537A18-6766-4DEF-9E59-426B4FEE2844" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="TextRun SCXW107265725 BCX0" lang="ES-CL" xml:lang="ES-CL" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW107265725 BCX0">https://api.mercadopublico.cl/servicios/v1/publico/licitaciones.json?fecha=</span></span><span class="TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW107265725 BCX0" lang="ES-CL" xml:lang="ES-CL" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW107265725 BCX0">02022014</span></span><span class="TextRun SCXW107265725 BCX0" lang="ES-CL" xml:lang="ES-CL" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW107265725 BCX0">&amp;ticket=F8537A18-6766-4DEF-9E59-426B4FEE2844</span></span></a><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW107265725 BCX0"><span class="SCXW107265725 BCX0">&#xA0;</span><br class="SCXW107265725 BCX0"></span></p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h2 style="font-size: 16px;color: #07272d;line-height: 1,4;text-align: left;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:500;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading">Por estado "activas"</h2><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
