</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1779314173414-3c816536-1d12" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a href="#1779314173414-3c816536-1d12" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">COMPRA &#xC1;GIL</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><a href="http://www.chilecompra.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Documentacion_API_Compra_Agil-2-1.pdf">Descarga la gu&#xED;a de uso para usar la API de Compra &#xC1;gil</a></p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><a href="http://www.chilecompra.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Documentacion_API_Compra_Agil-3-1.pdf">Revisa 5 ejemplos pr&#xE1;cticos para empezar</a></p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1769539783438-da38d44f-342d" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a href="#1769539783438-da38d44f-342d" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">&#xD3;RDENES DE COMPRA</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><span class="TextRun Highlight SCXW182095164 BCX0" lang="ES-CL" style="color: #07272d;" xml:lang="ES-CL" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW182095164 BCX0" data-ccp-charstyle="vkekvd" data-ccp-charstyle-defn='{"ObjectId":"010c47eb-537a-590a-8ea6-17af30892813|1","ClassId":1073872969,"Properties":[201342446,"1",201342447,"5",201342448,"1",201342449,"1",469777841,"Aptos",469777842,"",469777843,"Aptos",469777844,"Aptos",201341986,"1",469769226,"Aptos",268442635,"24",469775450,"vkekvd",201340122,"1",134233614,"true",469778129,"vkekvd",335572020,"1",469778324,"Default Paragraph Font"]}'>Tienes acceso a informaci&#xF3;n para listar:</span></span></p>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">&#xD3;rdenes de&#xA0;compra diarias&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">&#xD3;rdenes&#xA0;de&#xA0;compra&#xA0;por c&#xF3;digo&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">&#xD3;rdenes&#xA0;de&#xA0;compra&#xA0;diarias por estado&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">&#xD3;rdenes&#xA0;de&#xA0;compra&#xA0;por d&#xED;a&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">&#xD3;rdenes&#xA0;de&#xA0;compra&#xA0;por estado y d&#xED;a&#xA0;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="3" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="6" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;">&Oacute;rdenes&nbsp;de&nbsp;compra&nbsp;por c&oacute;digo de organismo p&uacute;blico o <a class="glossaryLink"  aria-describedby="tt"  data-cmtooltip="&lt;div class=glossaryItemTitle&gt;Proveedor&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=glossaryItemBody&gt;&amp;lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;Persona natural o jur&iacute;dica, chilena o extranjera, o agrupaci&oacute;n de las mismas, que puedan proporcionar bienes y/o servicios a las instituciones del Estado.&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;&amp;lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&amp;gt;&lt;/div&gt;"  href="https://www.chilecompra.cl/glosario/proveedor/"  data-gt-translate-attributes='[{"attribute":"data-cmtooltip", "format":"html"}]'  tabindex='0' role='link'>proveedor</a>&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="color: #07272d;">La API&#xA0;fue implementada para que las&#xA0;URLs&#xA0;puedan ser utilizadas mediante par&#xE1;metros&#xA0;GET, con el objetivo de indicar las caracter&#xED;sticas de la petici&#xF3;n que se ejecuta.</span></p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h2 style="font-size: 18px;color: #07272d;line-height: 1,4;text-align: left;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:500;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading">Servicio web</h2><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><span style="color: #07272d;">Los archivos de los recursos a los que se accede a trav&#xE9;s de api.mercadopublico.cl, utilizan las siguientes estructuras:&#xA0;</span></p>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="11" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;"><b>Formato JSON:</b>&#xA0;</span><br>
<span style="color: #07272d;">https://api.mercadopublico.cl/servicios/v1/publico/<b>ordenesdecompra.json</b>?fecha=02022014&amp;ticket=F8537A18-6766-4DEF-9E59-426B4FEE2844&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="&#xF0B7;" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="11" data-list-defn-props='{"335552541":1,"335559685":720,"335559991":360,"469769226":"Symbol","469769242":[8226],"469777803":"left","469777804":"&#xF0B7;","469777815":"multilevel"}' data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span style="color: #07272d;"><b>Formato JSONP:</b>&#xA0;</span><br>
<span style="color: #07272d;">https://api.mercadopublico.cl/servicios/v1/publico/<b>ordenesdecompra.jsonp</b>?fecha=02022014&amp;callback=respuesta&amp;ticket=F8537A18-6766-4DEF-9E59-426B4FEE2844&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
