		</figure>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6 vc_col-has-fill"><div class="vc_column-inner vc_custom_1776895386258"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h2 style="font-size: 12px;color: #07272d;line-height: 1,4;text-align: left;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading">Marzo 26, 2026</h2><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h2 style="font-size: 18px;color: #07272d;line-height: 1,4;text-align: left;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:400;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading"><a href="https://www.chilecompra.cl/2026/03/chilecompra-impulsa-la-evolucion-de-sus-apis-con-taller-de-co-creacion/" target=" _blank">ChileCompra impulsa la evoluci&#xF3;n de sus APIs con taller de co-creaci&#xF3;n</a></h2><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_dotted vc_sep_pos_align_left vc_separator_no_text vc_sep_color_black"><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h2 style="font-size: 12px;color: #07272d;line-height: 1,4;text-align: left;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:300;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading">Febrero 3, 2026</h2><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><h2 style="font-size: 18px;color: #07272d;line-height: 1,4;text-align: left;font-family:Roboto;font-weight:400;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading"><a href="https://www.chilecompra.cl/2026/02/hasta-el-20-de-febrero-se-amplio-el-plazo-para-participar-en-la-consulta-publica-sobre-la-evolucion-de-apis-y-acceso-a-datos-abiertos/" target=" _blank">Hasta el 20 de febrero se ampli&#xF3; el plazo para participar en la consulta p&#xFA;blica sobre la evoluci&#xF3;n de APIs y acceso a datos abiertos</a></h2><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 10px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_dotted vc_sep_pos_align_left vc_separator_no_text vc_sep_color_black"><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
